draft --> offered : promoter offers (60)
offered --> withdrawn : promoter withdraws (61)
offered --> agreed : sponsor buys on the market (92)
draft -[dotted]-> offered : sponsor cannot offer (62)
draft -[dotted]-> agreed : sponsor cannot buy what is not on offer (94)
offered -[dotted]-> agreed : sponsor cannot buy a campaign holding a sold package (96)
withdrawn --> [*]
agreed --> [*]
